{
 "_comment": "The vanilla bot-population baseline, per map, read out of a stock SPT 4.x database rather than typed from memory. mods/morebots scales FROM these numbers and never from whatever the database currently holds, so applying a multiplier twice gives the same answer as applying it once. Without a fixed baseline, a mod that reads BotMax, multiplies it and writes it back doubles the map every server restart, and the only symptom is that the game gets slower every week. `waves` is positional: entry n here is entry n of locations.<map>.base.waves.",
